00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.245
ALAN SCHUSSMAN: Sure, sure.

00:19:30.245 --> 00:19:34.790
But, yeah, super large
organization, very matrixed.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:38.210
I've always sat within a
