00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.280
sets than would usually
even be tackling

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:19.090
some of these problems versus
kind of with your tech team

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:24.310
or data engineering team or
breaking all those pieces up.

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:29.790
But, yeah, we definitely have a
